 "html": "<div class=\"body-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-1 dnd_area-row-0-force-full-width-section dnd-section dnd_area-row-0-padding\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span\">\n<div id=\"m-dnd_area-module-1\"><div class=\"hp-hero hp-hero--x-small hp--dark hp--margin-t-0 hp--margin-b-0\"><div class=\"hp-video-background-plyr hp-video-background-plyr--pos-bottom hp-bg\" inert=\"\"><video class=\"plyr__video-embed\" data-disablemobile=\"false\" data-playmode=\"loop\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"/files/shutterstock-1103263419.mp4\"></video>\n</div><div class=\"hp--abs-full hp-bg-overlay\" style=\"background-color: rgba(1, 110, 143, 0.4)\"></div><div class=\"page-center hp-hero__info-box\"><h1 class=\"hp-hero__title hp-heading-style--default hp--toc-ignore\"><span class=\"hp-hero__title-inner\">ABOUT US</span></h1><div class=\"hp-rich-text hp-hero__desc\">\n<p><span>A Family Owned Pool Company Bringing Families Closer Together Since 2018</span></p>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-2 dnd_area-row-1-padding dnd_area-row-1-vertical-alignment dnd-section dnd_area-row-1-background-gradient dnd_area-row-1-background-layers\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span6 widget-span dnd-column cell_1701737447364-vertical-alignment\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-3 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span widget_1701737712882-padding\">\n<div id=\"m-widget_1701737712882\">\n<div class=\"hp-mini-tag hp--clearfix hp--dark\" style=\"background-color: rgba(1, 110, 143, 1.0);  \">\n<div class=\"hp-mini-tag__content-wrapper\"><span class=\"hp-mini-tag__title\">About Us</span></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-4 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span\">\n<div id=\"m-module_17017374473645\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-cta hp-sec-cta--vertical hp--light hp--padding-t-0 hp--padding-b-0 hp--margin-t-0 hp--margin-b-0\" style=\"background-color: rgba(1, 110, 143, 0.0); \">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-cta--content page-center hp--relative\"><h2 class=\"hp-sec-cta__title hp-heading-style--h2 hp-sec-cta__title--vertical hp-sec__title--narrow hp--toc-ignore\">The Value A Swimming Pool Brings A Family</h2><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-sec-cta__desc hp-sec-cta__desc--vertical\">\n<p>A swimming pool is so much more than just a pool! It's a place where kids can splash, play and be just that kids! A place where you can relax and self-soothe after a stressful day, a place where you can spend a romantic evening with your spouse and a place where you can entertain friends by the pool on a scorching summer day while grilling burgers and enjoying some time with those that matter.</p>\n<p>Our passion for pools stems from their ability to bring immense value through family, friendship, peace, exercise and beauty all in your own backyard.</p></span><div class=\"hp-sec-cta__cta-wrapper\">\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"span6 widget-span cell_17017374473642-vertical-alignment dnd-column\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-5 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span module_17017374473649-flexbox-positioning\">\n<div id=\"m-module_17017374473649\">\n<span id=\"m-module_17017374473649_\"><img alt=\"Kassandharrison\" height=\"964\" loading=\"eager\" src=\"/files/kassandharrison.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" title=\"Kassandharrison\" width=\"1536\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-6 dnd-section\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span dnd-column\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-7 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span\">\n<div id=\"m-widget_1701740051586\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-cta hp-sec-cta--vertical hp--light hp--padding-t-0 hp--sec-padding-b-md hp--margin-t-0 hp--margin-b-0\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-cta--content page-center hp--align-c hp--relative\"><h2 class=\"hp-sec-cta__title hp-heading-style--h2 hp-sec-cta__title--vertical hp-sec__title--narrow hp--toc-ignore\">A Deeper Dive</h2><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-sec-cta__desc hp-sec-cta__desc--vertical\">\n<span>(Pun Intended)</span></span><div class=\"hp-sec-cta__cta-wrapper\">\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-8 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span\">\n<div id=\"m-widget_1701739376912\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-values hp--light hp--margin-t-0 hp--margin-b-0\">\n<div class=\"hp--relative\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-values__listing hp-sec-values__listing--three-items hp--clearfix\"><div class=\"hp-value hp-touch-btn-container\"><div class=\"hp-3D-box\">\n<div class=\"hp-value__img hp-3D-box__sensor hp-3D-box--shaddow-on-hover\">\n<img alt=\"046A0242\" class=\"hp-background-img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/046a0242.jpg\" style=\"object-fit: cover;object-position: center;\"/><div class=\"hp-touch-btn hp-touch-btn--dark\">TOUCH<span class=\"hp-touch-btn__icon\"></span></div><div class=\"hp-value__overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"hp-value__front hp-3D-box__info-box\"><div class=\"hp-value__title hp-heading-style--h2\">Who We Are</div></div>\n<div class=\"hp-value__back hp-3D-box__info-box\"><div class=\"hp-value__title hp-heading-style--h2\">Who We Are</div><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-value__desc\"><p><span>Hipel Land &amp; Pool Inc. is a family-owned and operated pool company specializing in In-ground swimming pool design and build. Located in Kitchener, ON we serve our immediate surrounding communities.</span></p></span></div>\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"hp-value hp-touch-btn-container\"><div class=\"hp-3D-box\">\n<div class=\"hp-value__img hp-3D-box__sensor hp-3D-box--shaddow-on-hover\">\n<img alt=\"Imagine Fiberglass Pools Illusion 35\" class=\"hp-background-img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/imagine-fiberglass-pools-illusion-35.jpg\" style=\"object-fit: cover;object-position: center;\"/><div class=\"hp-touch-btn hp-touch-btn--dark\">TOUCH<span class=\"hp-touch-btn__icon\"></span></div><div class=\"hp-value__overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"hp-value__front hp-3D-box__info-box\"><div class=\"hp-value__title hp-heading-style--h2\">Our Mission</div></div>\n<div class=\"hp-value__back hp-3D-box__info-box\"><div class=\"hp-value__title hp-heading-style--h2\">Our Mission</div><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-value__desc\"><p><span>Bring value to families by creating outdoor spaces where relaxation, fun, and family time, blossom into lasting lifetime memories.</span></p></span></div>\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"hp-value hp-touch-btn-container\"><div class=\"hp-3D-box\">\n<div class=\"hp-value__img hp-3D-box__sensor hp-3D-box--shaddow-on-hover\">\n<img alt=\"Vinyl Liner Kidney\" class=\"hp-background-img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/vinyl-liner-kidney.jpg\" style=\"object-fit: cover;object-position: center;\"/><div class=\"hp-touch-btn hp-touch-btn--dark\">TOUCH<span class=\"hp-touch-btn__icon\"></span></div><div class=\"hp-value__overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"hp-value__front hp-3D-box__info-box\"><div class=\"hp-value__title hp-heading-style--h2\">What We Do</div></div>\n<div class=\"hp-value__back hp-3D-box__info-box\"><div class=\"hp-value__title hp-heading-style--h2\">What We Do</div><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-value__desc\"><ul>\n<li>Fiberglass Pools</li>\n<li>Custom Pools</li>\n<li>Landscaping.</li>\n<li>Design &amp; Build</li>\n<li>Pool Education</li>\n<li>Bring Families Together</li>\n</ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-9 dnd-section dnd_area-row-3-padding dnd_area-row-3-force-full-width-section\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span dnd-column\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-10 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span\">\n<div id=\"m-module_17017390321573\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-split hp-sec-split--flipped hp--align-c hp-sec-split--invert-cols hp--dark hp--margin-t-0 hp--margin-b-0\">\n<div class=\"hp--relative\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid hp--clearfix hp--flip-container\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-split__left hp--relative\" style=\"background-color: rgba(1, 110, 143, 1.0); \">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-split__content hp--relative\"><span class=\"hp-sec__title-intro hp--margin-centered hp-sec-split__title-intro\">\n            Swimming Pool Contractors In Kitchener, ON\n          </span><h2 class=\"hp-sec__title hp-heading-style--default hp-sec-split__title\">Swimming Pool Professionals</h2><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-sec__desc hp-sec-split__desc\">\n<p>The company founded by Kadison Hipel in 2018 originally began operating under the name “Landscape Advantage” and specialized in Interlocking stone, retaining walls, patios, walkways and other landscape construction-based services. Growing up with a swimming pool in the family Kadison had a passion for pools and began offering pool installation services in 2019 and incorporated the business as “Hipel Land &amp; Pool Inc” in 2021 bringing on his brother Jayden as a partner. Since 2019 we have installed over 100 inground swimming pools throughout Ontario.</p>\n<p>The team at Hipel has refined a process that makes the customer experience both enjoyable and memorable all while developing lasting relationships with our customers.</p>\n</span><div class=\"hp-cta-container hp-sec-split__cta-container hp--clearfix\">\n<div class=\"hp--neg-margin-lr-10\"><div class=\"hp-cta-container__cta hp-sec-split__cta hp-cta hp-cta--regular-solid-primary-background\">\n<a class=\"hp-cta_button\" href=\"/en-ca/request-a-quote\" role=\"button\">Request A Quote</a>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-sec-split__right\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-split__img hp-sec-split__img--mode-cover\" style=\"background-color: rgba(1, 110, 143, 1.0);\">\n<img alt=\"swimming pool company\" class=\"hp-background-img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/jaydenandnate.jpg\" style=\"object-fit: cover;object-position: center;\"/>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-11 dnd-section dnd_area-row-4-force-full-width-section dnd_area-row-4-padding\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span module_17259103969593-hidden\">\n<div id=\"m-module_17259103969593\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-team hp-sec-team--tabs hp-sec-team--style-full hp--align-c hp--light hp--sec-padding-t-md hp--sec-padding-b-md hp--margin-t-0 hp--margin-b-0\" style=\"background-color: rgba(244, 246, 250, 1.0); \">\n<div class=\"page-center hp--relative\"><div class=\"hp-sec-team__intro-sec hp-sec__intro-sec\"><h2 class=\"hp-sec__title hp-heading-style--default hp-sec__title--narrow hp-sec-team__title\">Our Team, Our Family</h2><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-sec__desc hp-sec-team__desc\">\n<p><span>Hipel Pools Is A Family Business Locally Owned &amp; Operated In Kitchener, ON</span></p>\n</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"page-center hp--relative\">\n<div class=\"hp-team-members hp--clearfix\">\n<div class=\"hp-tabs\">\n<div class=\"hp-tabs__header\">\n<ul aria-label=\"Filter\" class=\"hp-tabs__tab-wrapper hp-tabs__tab-wrapper--centered\" role=\"tablist\"><li aria-label=\"Team\" aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"hp-tabs__tab keyboard-clickable hp-tabs__tab--active\" rel=\"tab1\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\">Team</li></ul>\n<div class=\"hp-form hp-form--style-1 hp-tabs__dropdown\">\n<select aria-label=\"Filter\"><option value=\"tab1\">Team</option></select>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"hp-tabs__body\"><div class=\"hp-tabs__content hp--neg-margin-lr-10 hp--clearfix hp-mh-group-byRow\" id=\"tab1\"><div class=\"hp-team-member hp-team-member--style-full hp-touch-btn-container\" style=\"z-index: \">\n<div class=\"hp-3D-box\">\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__img hp-team-member__img--style-full hp-3D-box__sensor hp-3D-box--shaddow-on-hover\">\n<img alt=\"Kadison Hipel Is the president &amp; founder of Hipel Pools a swimming pool builder and contractor in Kitchener, ON\" class=\"hp-background-img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/kadison-1-1.jpg\" style=\"object-fit: cover;\"/>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"hp-touch-btn\">TOUCH<span class=\"hp-touch-btn__icon\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__info-box--style-full hp-3D-box__info-box hp-3D-box__info-box--centered\">\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__name\">KADISON HIPEL</span>\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__job-title hp-team-member__job-title--style-full\">Founder/President</span><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-team-member__desc\"><span>Kadison’s primary responsibilities are sales &amp; marketing but also involve the continuous effort to improve Hipel Pools and our teams abilities.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__name-tag\">\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__name\">KADISON HIPEL</span>\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__job-title\">Founder/President</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"hp-team-member hp-team-member--style-full hp-touch-btn-container\" style=\"z-index: \">\n<div class=\"hp-3D-box\">\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__img hp-team-member__img--style-full hp-3D-box__sensor hp-3D-box--shaddow-on-hover\">\n<img alt=\"Jayden Hipel Swimming pool builder &amp; operations manager at Hipel Pools\" class=\"hp-background-img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/jayden.jpg\" style=\"object-fit: cover;\"/>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"hp-touch-btn\">TOUCH<span class=\"hp-touch-btn__icon\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__info-box--style-full hp-3D-box__info-box hp-3D-box__info-box--centered\">\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__name\">JAYDEN HIPEL</span>\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__job-title hp-team-member__job-title--style-full\">Partner/Operations Manager</span><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-team-member__desc\"><span>Jayden is actively involved on-site in every Hipel Pools project. Responsible for managing our team of pool craftsmen, project logistics, and quality control.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__name-tag\">\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__name\">JAYDEN HIPEL</span>\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__job-title\">Partner/Operations Manager</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"hp-team-member hp-team-member--style-full hp-touch-btn-container\" style=\"z-index: \">\n<div class=\"hp-3D-box\">\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__img hp-team-member__img--style-full hp-3D-box__sensor hp-3D-box--shaddow-on-hover\">\n<img alt=\"Nathan Pockett Hipel Pools Pool Foreman &amp; Builder\" class=\"hp-background-img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/nathan.jpg\" style=\"object-fit: cover;\"/>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"hp-touch-btn\">TOUCH<span class=\"hp-touch-btn__icon\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__info-box--style-full hp-3D-box__info-box hp-3D-box__info-box--centered\">\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__name\">Nathan Pockett</span>\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__job-title hp-team-member__job-title--style-full\">Pool Construction Foreman</span><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-team-member__desc\"><span>Nathan is one of the longest-standing employees of Hipel Pools and joined our team in the company's early days. A perfectionist, skilled fiberglass pool builder, and equipment operator Nate has been a part of nearly 100 pool builds and is a critical part to every pool our team is apart of.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__name-tag\">\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__name\">Nathan Pockett</span>\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__job-title\">Pool Construction Foreman</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"hp-team-member hp-team-member--style-full hp-touch-btn-container\" style=\"z-index: \">\n<div class=\"hp-3D-box\">\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__img hp-team-member__img--style-full hp-3D-box__sensor hp-3D-box--shaddow-on-hover\">\n<img alt=\"JENNIFER HIPEL\" class=\"hp-background-img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/imported-sitepage-images/364256832-982670282782965-1648866529854628169-n-1199x800.jpg\" style=\"object-fit: cover;\"/>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"hp-touch-btn\">TOUCH<span class=\"hp-touch-btn__icon\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__info-box--style-full hp-3D-box__info-box hp-3D-box__info-box--centered\">\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__name\">JENNIFER HIPEL</span>\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__job-title hp-team-member__job-title--style-full\">Office Manager</span><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-team-member__desc\"><span>Jennifer will be your initial point of contact when working with us and is responsible for customer communications, accounting, and project coordination.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__name-tag\">\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__name\">JENNIFER HIPEL</span>\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__job-title\">Office Manager</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"hp-team-member hp-team-member--style-full hp-touch-btn-container\" style=\"z-index: \">\n<div class=\"hp-3D-box\">\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__img hp-team-member__img--style-full hp-3D-box__sensor hp-3D-box--shaddow-on-hover\">\n<img alt=\"Al Forsythe\" class=\"hp-background-img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/al-forsyth.jpg\" style=\"object-fit: cover;\"/>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"hp-touch-btn\">TOUCH<span class=\"hp-touch-btn__icon\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__info-box--style-full hp-3D-box__info-box hp-3D-box__info-box--centered\">\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__name\">Al Forsythe</span>\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__job-title hp-team-member__job-title--style-full\">Vinyl Liner &amp; Service Expert</span><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-team-member__desc\"><span>Al has well over 30+ years of experience in the pool industry and is a wealth of knowledge for our customers and team. Al has built hundreds of pools in his career and loves to share his knowledge with the younger members of our team. When Al isn't working on pools you can find him at a car show with his 2002 Corvette.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__name-tag\">\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__name\">Al Forsythe</span>\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__job-title\">Vinyl Liner &amp; Service Expert</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"hp-team-member hp-team-member--style-full hp-touch-btn-container\" style=\"z-index: \">\n<div class=\"hp-3D-box\">\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__img hp-team-member__img--style-full hp-3D-box__sensor hp-3D-box--shaddow-on-hover\">\n<img alt=\"Dylan Carson Pool Contractor Kitchener, ON\" class=\"hp-background-img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/dylan.jpg\" style=\"object-fit: cover;\"/>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__overlay\"></div>\n<div class=\"hp-touch-btn\">TOUCH<span class=\"hp-touch-btn__icon\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__info-box--style-full hp-3D-box__info-box hp-3D-box__info-box--centered\">\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__name\">Dylan Carson</span>\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__job-title hp-team-member__job-title--style-full\">Construction Team</span><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-team-member__desc\"><span>Dylan, although young, has been in the pool industry since his early teens. Pursuing a career as a future ER Doctor, Dylan is only with us for the summer months while he pursues his education, but over the years, he has become a vital part of the Hipel Pools Team</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"hp-team-member__name-tag\">\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__name\">Dylan Carson</span>\n<span class=\"hp-team-member__job-title\">Construction Team</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-12 dnd-section\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span dnd-column\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-13 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span\">\n<div id=\"m-widget_1698375148961\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-timeline hp-mh-group-byRow hp-sec-timeline--with-intro hp--light hp--sec-padding-t-sm hp--sec-padding-b-sm hp--margin-t-0 hp--margin-b-0\">\n<div class=\"page-center hp--align-c\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-timeline__intro-sec hp-sec__intro-sec\"><span class=\"hp-sec__title-intro hp--margin-centered hp-sec__title-intro--narrow hp-sec-timeline__title-intro\">\n        Our Story\n      </span><h2 class=\"hp-sec__title hp-heading-style--default hp-sec__title--narrow hp-sec-timeline__title\">Company History 2018 - Today</h2></div>\n</div><div class=\"page-center hp--relative\">\n<ul class=\"hp-timeline hp-timeline--centered hp--clearfix\"><li class=\"hp-timeline-item hp--colored-box\"><img alt=\"Hipel Pools - The beginning \" class=\"hp-timeline-item__img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/403416291-1019980042641534-9178233390113763283-n.jpg\" style=\"object-fit: cover;object-position: center;\"/><div class=\"hp-timeline-item__content\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-timeline-item__title hp--toc-ignore\">2018  -  The Beginning</h3>\n<span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-timeline-item__desc\"><span>Kadison starts the business as \"Landscape Advantage\" specializing in interlocking stone patios, walkways, pool decks, retaining walls etc. The company consists of Kadison, 1 Employee, and 1 Truck</span></span>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"hp-timeline-item hp--colored-box\"><img alt=\"046A0242\" class=\"hp-timeline-item__img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/046a0242.jpg\" style=\"object-fit: cover;object-position: center;\"/><div class=\"hp-timeline-item__content\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-timeline-item__title hp--toc-ignore\">2019  -  Finding Our Way</h3>\n<span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-timeline-item__desc\"><span>After a successful year in business, Kadison is captivated by his family pool and begins exploring the possibility of pool building.</span></span>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"hp-timeline-item hp--colored-box\"><img alt=\"277111403_394799969158943_4241493129025079511_n\" class=\"hp-timeline-item__img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/277111403-394799969158943-4241493129025079511-n.jpg\" style=\"object-fit: cover;object-position: center;\"/><div class=\"hp-timeline-item__content\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-timeline-item__title hp--toc-ignore\">2020  -  Covid 19 Pandemic</h3>\n<span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-timeline-item__desc\"><p>The business continues to grow, Going from a two-person team to a four-person team. Pools have become the focus of the business. The Covid-19 Pandemic hits.</p></span>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"hp-timeline-item hp--colored-box\"><img alt=\"364193974_225995816597069_5597016036822314910_n-1199x800\" class=\"hp-timeline-item__img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/imported-sitepage-images/364193974-225995816597069-5597016036822314910-n-1199x800.jpg\" style=\"object-fit: cover;object-position: center;\"/><div class=\"hp-timeline-item__content\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-timeline-item__title hp--toc-ignore\">2022  -  A Family Business</h3>\n<span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-timeline-item__desc\"><span>The company has been incorporated as \"Hipel Land and Pool Inc\" - Kadison's brother Jayden joins the company as a partner and Jennifer (Mother) joins as office manager.</span></span>\n</div>\n</li><li class=\"hp-timeline-item hp--colored-box\"><img alt=\"384481295_308349545149412_6135811485225855996_n-1\" class=\"hp-timeline-item__img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/384481295-308349545149412-6135811485225855996-n-1.jpg\" style=\"object-fit: cover;object-position: center;\"/><div class=\"hp-timeline-item__content\">\n<h3 class=\"hp-timeline-item__title hp--toc-ignore\">2023  -  Yesterday's Struggles Today's Experience</h3>\n<span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-timeline-item__desc\"><span>The Hipel Pools team has grown to a 7-person team, with 4 Trucks, 5 Machines and 100+ pool installations.</span></span>\n</div>\n</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-14 dnd_area-row-6-padding dnd_area-row-6-vertical-alignment dnd_area-row-6-background-gradient dnd-section dnd_area-row-6-background-layers\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span6 widget-span cell_1701996808105-vertical-alignment dnd-column\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-15 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span module_17019967980369-flexbox-positioning\">\n<div id=\"m-module_17019967980369\">\n<span id=\"m-module_17019967980369_\"><img alt=\"Swimming pool contractors ontario\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/imported-sitepage-images/shutterstock-1835838235-800x534.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto;\" title=\"Swimming pool contractors ontario\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"span6 widget-span dnd-column cell_1701996798036-vertical-alignment\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-16 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span\">\n<div id=\"m-module_17019967980365\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-cta hp-sec-cta--vertical hp--light hp--padding-t-0 hp--padding-b-0 hp--margin-t-0 hp--margin-b-0\" style=\"background-color: rgba(1, 110, 143, 0.0); \">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-cta--content page-center hp--relative\"><h2 class=\"hp-sec-cta__title hp-heading-style--h2 hp-sec-cta__title--vertical hp-sec__title--narrow hp--toc-ignore\">Career Opportunities</h2><span class=\"hp-rich-text hp-sec-cta__desc hp-sec-cta__desc--vertical\">\n<p>As a team of highly skilled pool builders, we are always looking to add new members to our team who are exceptionally dedicated and passionate about their craft. If you're interested in joining an exceptional and supportive work environment with endless advancement opportunities we want to work with you. Explore our career opportunities or contact us for more information. </p></span><div class=\"hp-sec-cta__cta-wrapper\">\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-17 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span6 widget-span\">\n<div id=\"m-module_17019967980366\">\n<div class=\"hp-mini-cta hp--clearfix\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-right: 15px; \"><div class=\"hp-cta hp-cta--primary-solid hp-cta--full-width\">\n<a class=\"hp-cta_button\" title=\"Button Career Opportunities\">Career Opportunities</a>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"span6 widget-span\">\n<div id=\"m-module_17019967980367\">\n<div class=\"hp-mini-cta hp--clearfix\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-right: 15px; \"><div class=\"hp-cta hp-cta--regular-solid hp-cta--full-width\">\n<a class=\"hp-cta_button\" href=\"mailto:info@hipelpools.ca\" title=\"Button Contact Us\">Contact Us</a>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>"
}